OL,3,GNEWSAJamie-Lee O'Donnell: I'd love to
OL,4,Aknow what the Derry Girls characters
OL,5,Aare up to now
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than four years after Derry Girls
OL,8,Fcame to an emotional end, one of the
OL,9,Fshow's breakout stars says she hasn't
OL,10,Fruled out a return to the world of the
OL,11,Fhit comedy.
OL,13,FAnd while she isn't expecting a reunion
OL,14,Fany time soon, Jamie-Lee O'Donnell
OL,15,Fadmits she sometimes wonders what
OL,16,Fbecame of Michelle, Erin, Orla, Clare
OL,17,Fand James.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
