OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJamie-Lee O'Donnell: I'd love to
OL,4,Aknow what the Derry Girls characters
OL,5,Aare up to now
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I could see a time in the future where
OL,8,Fthere's a nice sort of Christmas
OL,9,Fspecial or a movie, who knows? But I
OL,10,Fmean, if it came up, I'd certainly go
OL,11,Ffor it. I'd like to see where all the
OL,12,Fcharacters are now."
OL,14,FO'Donnell's come along way from the
OL,15,Fblockbuster success of Derry Girls -
OL,16,Fhigh-profile roles in Screw, Leonard
OL,17,Fand Hungry Paul and the upcoming Hopley
OL,18,FHall.
